From 72ab66fc1fa199fb0c3cb50bbcb11af1dfed4b4a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 10:42:50 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(import): preserve STEP short-name length units

Normalize parsed GUAC and SUNT records before unit validation and topology reading.
Pin the dimensions and volume of authored inch and metre cubes.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #2919
